	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div xml:id="div1" corresp="regest1">
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>Gratia et pax a domino nostro, <persName ref="p495">Bullingere</persName> ornatissime.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Nosti, <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>quod semper apud nos concionatorum nostrorum<note xml:id="fna" type="footnote" n="a"><hi>Nach</hi> nostrorum <hi>gestrichenes</hi> liber et.</note> offutias mitigarim <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>(ut qui usque auspicatiora sperarim)<note xml:id="fnb" type="footnote" n="b"><hi>Klammern ergänzt.</hi></note>; ad quę etiam meo <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>periculo me illis opponendo connitabar<note xml:id="fn1" type="footnote" n="1">Zur Lage im in Buceraner und Zwinglianer gespaltenen <placeName ref="l41">Bern</placeName> s. zuletzt oben <ref target="file12267">Nr. 2220</ref>, 8-19.</note>.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Verum hac spe prorsus <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>deiectus dissimulare diutius nequeo, quin ingenue fatear <placeName ref="l41">Bernam</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>Lutherana sive Buceriana fece infectam, ut (quę fastuosa reddita <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>suaque mole sibi molesta, quod intestina odia calleat)<note xml:id="fnc" type="footnote" n="c"><hi>Klammern ergänzt.</hi></note> longinquas <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>amititias appetat et ambiat neglectis propinquis.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Luxus <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>et fastus [su]ccessu<note xml:id="fnd" type="footnote" n="d">[su]ccessu <hi>am Rande nachgetragen und im engen Einband z.T. verdeckt. - <persName ref="p2979">Johann Jakob Simler</persName> (Zürich ZB, Ms S 58, 142) las</hi> accessu.</note> ita redundant apud nos ut nihil supra, et, <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>quo magis concionatores nostri suam sententiam insinuent, <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>magnatibus et proceribus adblandiuntur.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Sic mutuum muli scabunt<note xml:id="fn2" type="footnote" n="2">mutuum muli scabunt: Adagia, 1, 7, 96 (<bibl>ASD</bibl> II/2 2241. Nr. 696).</note>.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z12"/>Vicissim itaque illis gratificatur, dum illuduntur, qui a veritate sta<lb xml:id="p1z13"/>nt.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Quam putas, optime <persName ref="p495">Bullingere</persName>, pectus meum, quod <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>philosophicum optarim, exulcerari?</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Quod si modo res <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>ad collationem redigi potuisset, quod sępius exposcebam, <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>sarta fuissent tecta<note xml:id="fn3" type="footnote" n="3">sarta tecta: Adagia, 4,5,37 (<bibl>ASD</bibl> II/7262-264, Nr. 3437).</note>.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Sed eo malignitatis evasere, quod <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>audire nolunt.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Nolunt moneri nec adhortari prorsus <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>omni veritatis cura ad concionatores relegata.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Sordemus <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>nos <placeName ref="l587">Tigurini</placeName> <placeName ref="l41">Bernatibus</placeName> oblitis universis benemeritis; inde <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>non immerito et <placeName ref="l41">Berna</placeName> mihi sordet.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Cupio, si fieri posset, <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>locum in patria<note xml:id="fn4" type="footnote" ana="bio" n="4"><persName ref="p3700">Rümlang</persName>, der aus <placeName ref="l555">Winterthur</placeName> stammte, blieb in <placeName ref="l41">Bern</placeName>; s. <bibl source="b10">HBBW VIII</bibl> 319, Anm. 8.</note> mihi apparari quacunque<pb type="edition" next="685"/> conditione, ut <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>canis meis receptus et asylum extaret.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la">Tu consule, <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>quid mihi faciendum censeas, ut<note xml:id="fne" type="footnote" n="e"><hi>ut fehlt in der Vorlage.</hi></note> tibi, fido meo patrono, <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>obsequar.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la">Confer et negotium hoc cum symmistis tuis.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z25"/>Statuo enim me a munere meo vindicare, huicque <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>renunciare brevi, meque deinde fatis bonisque viris committere.</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z27"/>Nihil detrectabo, modo literis impallescere liceat, etc.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z28"/>Audivit <placeName ref="l41">Berna</placeName> <placeName ref="l167">Genevam</placeName> per insidias ab <placeName ref="l875">Hispanis</placeName> quibusdam, <lb xml:id="p1z29"/>qui in <placeName ref="l736">Pedemontanis</placeName> partibus militarunt,<note xml:id="fn5" type="footnote" n="5">Zur Gefahr eines Überfalls <hi>auf</hi> <placeName ref="l167">Genf</placeName> ab November 1545 s. Jean-Antoine <hi>Gauner,</hi> Histoire de Genève des origines a l'année 1691, Bd. 3, Genf 1898, S. 243-249.</note> occupari; itaque <lb xml:id="p1z30"/>conscripsere exercitum ad subsidia et excubias agendas.</s>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z31"/><placeName ref="l167">Genevę</placeName> mille viros, si hostis adpropinquare auditur.</s>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la">Deinde <lb xml:id="p1z32"/>ad vexillum sex millia virorum delegit, quibus hostes <lb xml:id="p1z33"/>propulsare nititur.</s>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la">Deus adspiret, ut omnia salubriter ad nominis <lb xml:id="p1z34"/>sui gloriam nostręque salutis lętitiam succedant!</s>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la">Digni <lb xml:id="p1z35"/>sumus et abunde promeriti, quos deus virga castiget<note xml:id="fn6" type="footnote" n="6">Vgl. <cit type="bible"><ref>Ps 89 (Vulg. 88), 32f</ref></cit>; <cit type="bible"><ref>Ez 20, 37</ref></cit>; <cit type="bible"><ref>Hebr 12,6</ref></cit>.</note>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vale.</s>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z36"/>Raptim, 7. die decembris anno 1545.</s>
					<s n="24" xml:lang="la" ana="salute"><lb xml:id="p1z37"/>Salutabis, quęso, <persName ref="p8011">Gvaltherum</persName>, <persName ref="p473">Buchterum</persName>,<note xml:id="fn7" type="footnote" n="7"><persName ref="p473">Heinrich Buchter</persName>.</note> <persName ref="p8437">Erasmum</persName><note xml:id="fn8" type="footnote" n="8"><persName ref="p8437">Erasmus Schmid</persName>.</note> <lb xml:id="p1z38"/>omnesque, quorum pectori nomen meum hęret.</s>
					<s n="25" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell"><lb xml:id="p1z39"/>Optime tu cum universa tua familia vale denuo.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="26" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z40"/>Tuus <persName ref="p3700">Eberardus a Rumlang</persName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="address">[Adresse auf der Rückseite:]</note>
					<s n="27" xml:lang="de"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Dem erwirdigen, frommen <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>und hochgelerten man meister <lb xml:id="p2z3"/><persName ref="p495">Heinrich Bullinger</persName>n, predicanten <lb xml:id="p2z4"/><placeName ref="l587">Zürich</placeName> im Hochen Münster, <lb xml:id="p2z5"/>sinem lieben herren.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
